{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":68230,\"title\":\"Dream the Future\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"What will the future look like? How will new discoveries and research impact our everyday lives in 2050?\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kXAp00GuJywsT4zZGjzsyB8k4aH.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s5T7axeryYtOn6Y3buXNDqR4eU2.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2016,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":2,\"totalEpisodes\":20,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"CuriosityStream\"],\"countries\":[],\"lastAirDate\":\"2018-01-25\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":10205,\"name\":\"Sigourney Weaver\",\"character\":\"Narrator\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wTSnfktNBLd6kwQxgvkqYw6vEon.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"Py9oOo54LWM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Frv0SgrvA94\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"wqDdr6b0tjY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"What will the future look like? How will new discoveries and research impact our everyday lives in 2050?\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r7WjoDEKtR3gcMfyw7VbTk6Hiu9.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2017-11-16\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Cities of the Future\",\"overview\":\"What will our cities look like in 2050? How will they be able to accommodate the one million additional people who arrive every week? The challenge is enormous. To reduce the impact on the planet and the energy footprint and optimize exchanges within megacities, digital technologies will be crucial.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Home of the Future\",\"overview\":\"This episode will show how innovations in construction are burgeoning: 3D printing, material salvaging... In cities, homes will be modular and \\\\\\\"intelligent\\\\\\\" and the growing population will lead us to explore new spaces on Earth and even other planets...\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-19\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Medicine of the Future\",\"overview\":\"This episode will reveal how medicine in 2050 will be perfectly targeted and adapted to the individual as well as accessible to everyone. Just as science fiction already imagined, medicine in 2050 will be repairative and regenerative.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-23\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Transportation of the Future\",\"overview\":\"This episode will reveal a future in the making that is as astonishing as it is unexpected: new urban models, eco-mobility, self-driving cars, electric airplanes, revolutionary boats, and more.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-30\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Work of the Future\",\"overview\":\"New technologies will reshape and force us to rethink work. All around the world, researchers, innovators, and entrepreneurs reinvent our relationship with work to adapt us to this new era.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-07\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Waste of the Future\",\"overview\":\"Innovations are emerging around the world to considerably reduce our waste: development of circular economies, the spread of composting, repair cafes, etc. So, what will it be like in 2050?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-14\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Cooking of the Future\",\"overview\":\"Cuisine meets a vital need, but it is also a way of expressing pleasure, emotions, and sharing. With an hour on average spent everyday cooking, it is also at the heart of our daily lives. How will cooking respond to environmental challenges in the future?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-05\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Food of the Future\",\"overview\":\"This episode will reveal the ways in which our eating habits will be revolutionized: vegetable proteins, urban farming, connected supermarkets, personalized food, new flavour experiences and more.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-11\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Entertainment of the Future\",\"overview\":\"Today, virtual reality headsets are reaching the masses and can already let users dive into spectacular new worlds. From our couches, we can now float through space, fly over New York, or zip along roller coasters. But, what will it be like in the future?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-18\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Sport of the Future\",\"overview\":\"As we embark upon the 21st century, sports now occupy a central role in our lives. They set the pace of our daily routines, influence our lifestyles, and maintain our health and general well being. This episode will show how the athletes of 2050 will be spoiled with technological choices.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mtbT567bz5FJVvkgh1p5wF98WRp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-25\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2016-08-25\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}